[{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0089","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0089.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-14916","title":"Loytec LGATE-902 任意文件删除漏洞","description":"LOYTEC LGATE-902 楼宇自动化网关设备存在不安全的权限分配漏洞（CWE-732），远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过网络直接访问设备文件系统，利用该漏洞删除任意文件，导致设备关键功能失效或系统崩溃。该漏洞影响 LGATE-902 6.3.2 及之前版本，攻击无需任何认证或用户交互，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重。攻击者可通过发送特制 HTTP 请求利用该漏洞实现任意文件删除操作。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-14916"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-06-28T18:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:41:52Z","remediation":"立即将 LGATE-902 固件升级至 6.4.2 或更高版本（该版本已修复任意文件删除漏洞）。如无法立即升级，在防火墙上限制对设备 80/443 端口的访问来源，仅允许受信任管理 IP 连接，并禁用设备 Web 界面的匿名访问功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152453/Loytec-LGATE-902-XSS-Traversal-File-Deletion.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Apr/12","https://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Apr/12","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14916.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-14916.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14916.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-14916.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-14916-3319.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-14916-3318.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-14916-3320.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2018-14916.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Loytec LGATE-902/CVE-2018-14916.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-14916.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-14916.js"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0089.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0164","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0164.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-20470","title":"Tyto Sahi Pro 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Sahi Pro 7.x.x 及 8.0.0 版本 Web 报表模块存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用该漏洞，通过构造包含路径遍历序列的特制 HTTP 请求，绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意敏感文件（如配置文件、系统密码文件等）。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，影响所有默认配置下的 Sahi Pro 部署实例。公开的 PoC 已可在 ExploitDB 及 Nuclei 模板中获取，利用难度低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-20470"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-06-17T14:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:52:55Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Sahi Pro 9.0.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 web reports 模块中的目录遍历漏洞。如无法立即升级，可采取以下临时缓解措施：在 Sahi Pro 的配置文件中限制 web reports 模块的访问权限，仅允许本地主机或受信任的 IP 地址访问 _s_/dyn/Log_highlight 路径；或通过防火墙/反向代理对该路径实施访问控制，阻止外部未授权请求。同时检查服务器上是否存在敏感文件泄露，清除受影响目录下的无关文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153330/Sahi-Pro-7.x-8.x-Directory-Traversal.html","https://barriersec.com/2019/06/cve-2018-20470-sahi-pro/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47005","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20470.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-20470.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20470.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-20470.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-20470-3495.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-20470-3497.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-20470-3498.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-20470.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Sahi Pro/CVE-2018-20470.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2018/20xxx/CVE-2018-20470.json","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/Sahi-Pro/CVE-2018-20470/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0164.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0208","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-13382","title":"Fortinet FortiOS SSL VPN 未授权密码重置漏洞","description":"Fortinet FortiOS 及 FortiProxy 的 SSL VPN Web 门户存在授权不当漏洞（CWE-863），也被称为\"magic 后门\"。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 SSL VPN 登录页面发送包含特殊 magic 参数的精心构造的 HTTP 请求，绕过授权检查直接修改任意 SSL VPN 用户的密码，进而获取 VPN 访问权限。该漏洞影响 FortiOS 6.0.0 至 6.0.4、5.6.0 至 5.6.8、5.4.1 至 5.4.10 以及 FortiProxy 2.0.0、1.2.0 至 1.2.8、1.1.0 至 1.1.6、1.0.0 至 1.0.7 版本，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重，已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-13382"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-06-04T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:39:18Z","remediation":"升级 FortiOS 至 6.2.0/6.0.5/5.6.9/5.4.11 及以上版本，FortiProxy 升级至 2.0.1/1.2.9/1.1.7/1.0.8 及以上版本。若无法立即升级，可在 SSL VPN 管理界面限制可信源 IP 访问并启用多因素认证作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fortiguard.com/advisory/FG-IR-18-389","https://www.fortiguard.com/psirt/FG-IR-20-231","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-20