FortiProxy 多个版本，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害严重。攻击无需认证，仅需网络可达即可利用，已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，且网上已有公开的 Metasploit 模块和 PoC 脚本，实际攻击门槛极低。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-13379"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-06-04T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:39:18Z","remediation":"立即升级 FortiOS 至 6.0.5 及以上、5.6.8 及以上或 5.4.13 及以上版本；FortiProxy 升级至 1.2.9 及以上、1.1.7 及以上或 1.0.8 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在 SSL VPN 门户配置中禁用 HTTP 访问或限制来源 IP 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fortiguard.com/advisory/FG-IR-18-384","https://www.fortiguard.com/psirt/FG-IR-20-233","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-13379","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47287","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-13379.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-13379.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/976754950fcf68c46d91206b7029022222e8684c/2018/CVE-2018-13379.md","https://github.com/r1cksec/cheatsheets/blob/d5cc6d24474592639d45560098a2ad4d1aacf089/exploit/CVE-2018-13379.md","https://github.com/PaytmLabs/nerve/blob/0b2d58d829bb54cff2033c572bdde2fa93843558/rules/cves/rule_fortinet-cve-2018-13379.py","https://github.com/lal0ne/vulnerability/blob/5b9f397c1970203b1764fb7a66a0ffac39bef4cc/Fortinet/FortinetSSL VPN/CVE-2018-13379/README.md","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/FortiOS/CVE-2018-13379/README.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/b8843912aad5f3df7a6246b49ce2c90d39da4b12/data/by-cve/CVE-2018-13379.md","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-13379.js","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/b8843912aad5f3df7a6246b49ce2c90d39da4b12/data/2018/CVE-2018-13379-B1anda0_CVE-2018-13379.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/b8843912aad5f3df7a6246b49ce2c90d39da4b12/data/2018/CVE-2018-13379-kh4sh3i_CVE-2018-13379.md","https://github.com/W01fh4cker/Serein","https://github.com/milo2012/CVE-2018-13379","https://github.com/hackingyseguridad/directoriotraversal","https://github.com/Blazz3/cve2018-13379-nmap-script","https://github.com/B1anda0/CVE-2018-13379"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0206.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0080","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0080.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-13380","title":"Fortinet FortiOS SSL VPN 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Fortinet FortiOS 和 FortiProxy 的 SSL VPN Web 门户中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，攻击者可通过向 error 或 message 处理参数中注入恶意脚本代码，当管理员或用户访问特制链接时，脚本将在受害者浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞影响 FortiOS 6.0.0 至 6.0.4、5.6.0 至 5.6.7、5.4.0 至 5.4.12、5.2 及以下版本，以及 FortiProxy 2.0.0、1.2.8 及以下版本。攻击无需身份认证，但需用户交互（点击恶意链接），CVSS 评分 4.7，危害等级中危。Fortinet 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2018-13380"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-06-04T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:39:18Z","remediation":"升级 FortiOS 至 6.0.5 及以上、5.6.8 及以上、5.4.13 及以上版本，或升级 FortiProxy 至 2.0.1 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在 SSL VPN 配置中对 error 和 message 参数进行输入过滤，或通过防火墙策略限制 SSL VPN 门户的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fortiguard.com/advisory/FG-IR-18-383","https://fortiguard.com/advisory/FG-IR-20-230","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-13380.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-13380.md","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/pocs_go/CVE-2018-13380.go","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-13380.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-13380.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-13380-3285.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-13380-3288.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-13380-3287.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-13380-3286.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Fortinet FortiOS/CVE-2018-13380.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-13380.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0080.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0082","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0082.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-14013","title":"Synacor Zimbra Collaboration Suite 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Synacor Zimbra Collaboration Suite 8.8.11 之前版本的 AJAX 和 HTML Web 客户端存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，通过向目标用户发送特制的恶意链接，诱使用户点击后触发 XSS 攻击，导致在用户浏览器上下文中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，可能窃取会话 Cookie、重定向至钓鱼页面或篡改页面内容。该漏洞影响广泛部署的企业邮件协作系统，攻击条件仅需用户交互，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-14013"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-05-29T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:40:29Z","remediation":"升级 Zimbra Collaboration Suite 至 8.8.11 或更高版本，该版本已修复 AJAX 和 HTML Web 客户端中的 XSS 漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx/Apache）添加 WAF 规则过滤 XSS 载荷，并限制用户输入中的特殊字符（如 `<` `>` `\"` `'`）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/151472/Zimbra-Collaboration-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Feb/3","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/01/30/1","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106787","https://bugzilla.zimbra.com/show_bug.cgi?id=109017","https://bugzilla.zimbra.com/show_bug.cgi?id=109018","https://wiki.zimbra.com/wiki/Zimbra_Security_Advisories","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14013.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-14013.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14013.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-14013.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-14013-3296.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-14013-3298.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Zimbra Collaboration Suite/CVE-2018-14013.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-14013.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-14013.js","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14013.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2018/14xxx/CVE-2018-14013.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0082.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0209","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0209.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-13383","title":"Fortinet FortiOS SSL VPN 堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Fortinet FortiOS 及 FortiProxy 的 SSL VPN Web 门户存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于在代理网页时未能正确处理 JavaScript href 数据，导致已登录用户的 SSL VPN Web 服务异常终止。攻击者需具备低权限且通过网络远程触发，影响 FortiOS 6.0.0 至 6.0.4、5.6.0 至 5.6.10、5.4.0 至 5.4.12、5.2.14 及更早版本，以及 FortiProxy 2.0.0、1.2.8 及更早版本。CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-13383"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-05-29T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:39:18Z","remediation":"升级 FortiOS 至 6.0.5/5.6.11/5.4.13/5.2.15 及以上版本，FortiProxy 升级至 1.2.9 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 SSL-VPN 服务（执行 config vpn ssl settings → unset source-interface），并为 SSL-VPN 用户启用双因素认证作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fortiguard.com/advisory/FG-IR-18-388","https://fortiguard.com/advisory/FG-IR-20-229","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-13383","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-13383.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2018/13xxx/CVE-2018-13383.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/95f29039d9df9f64ea752bc1ef04de2ad5981e05/2018/13xxx/CVE-2018-13383.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-13383.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-13383.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-13383.json","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web安全/Fortinet FortiOS/（CVE-2018-13383）Fortinet FortiOS 缓冲区错误漏洞.md","https://github.com/badboycxcc/IoT_Vulnerability_Wiki/blob/04ed805079843620ae861d42c5be52958867c52c/docs/防火墙/(CVE-2018-13383)Fortinet-FortiOS-缓冲区错误漏洞.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-13383.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-13383.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0209.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0209.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-1006","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-1006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7841","title":"Schneider Electric U.Motion Builder 操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"施耐德电气 U.Motion Builder 1.3.4 版本中存在 SQL 注入漏洞（CWE-89），攻击者无需认证即可通过向 `track_import_export.php` 的 `object_id` 参数传入特制字符触发该漏洞，导致未授权命令执行。该漏洞可被远程利用，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，成功利用后可完全控制目标系统，造成机密性、完整性和可用性全部丧失。CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。目前已有公开的 ExploitDB 利用代码和 Nuclei 检测模板。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7841"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-05-22T20:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:03:50Z","remediation":"该产品（U.motion Builder 1.3.4）已停产（end-of-life），施耐德电气未发布安全补丁。CISA 在已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV）中明确要求立即断开该产品的网络连接并停止使用。如因业务需要暂时无法下线，应在网络边界防火墙设置规则，仅允许受信 IP 访问 U.motion Builder 的管理端口（默认 80/443），并在反向代理层对 `track_import_export.php` 等接口的 `object_id` 参数实施严格的输入过滤和参数化查询，同时持续监控异常 SQL 语句和命令执行行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152862/Schneider-Electric-U.Motion-Builder-1.3.4-Command-Injection.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/May/26","https://www.schneider-electric.com/ww/en/download/document/SEVD-2019-071-02","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-7841","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46846","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7841.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-7841.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7841.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2018/7xxx/CVE-2018-7841.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-7841.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-7841.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-7841.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-7841.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-7841.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-7841.json","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7841.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-1006.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-1006.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-1006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0308","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-14839","title":"LG N1A1 NAS 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"LG N1A1 NAS 设备固件版本 3718.510 存在远程命令执行漏洞，攻击者可通过 HTTP POST 请求向设备发送特制参数，在未经身份认证的情况下远程执行任意系统命令。该漏洞源于设备未对用户输入进行有效过滤，导致 OS 命令注入（CWE-78）。攻击者无需任何权限即可利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，可导致设备完全受控。建议用户立即升级固件或限制设备管理接口的网络访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-14839"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-05-14T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:41:44Z","remediation":"立即将 LG N1A1 NAS 固件升级至厂商发布的最新版本（高于 3718.510）。如无法升级，在防火墙上将 NAS 管理端口（80/443）仅限可信管理 IP 访问，禁止从公网直接访问 NAS Web 管理界面，并禁用不必要的 CGI 功能模块作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://medium.com/%400x616163/lg-n1a1-unauthenticated-remote-command-injection-cve-2018-14839-9d2cf760e247","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-14839","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-14839.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2018/14xxx/CVE-2018-14839.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2018/14xxx/CVE-2018-14839.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-14839.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-14839.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-14839.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-14839.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-14839.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-14839.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2018/CVE-2018-14839/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0308.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0101","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0101.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-16139","title":"BIBLIOsoft BIBLIOpac 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"BIBLIOsoft BIBLIOpac 2008 存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 `bin/wxis.exe/bibliopac/` 页面的 `db` 或 `action` 参数注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码触发该漏洞。攻击无需身份认证，但需诱使用户点击恶意链接，成功利用后可窃取用户会话凭证、劫持页面内容或发起钓鱼攻击。该漏洞影响 BIBLIOsoft BIBLIOpac 2008 版本，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-16139"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-05-13T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:43:45Z","remediation":"厂商已声明 BIBLIOpac 2008 停止维护且不发布补丁，建议立即升级到 BIBLIOsoft 最新版产品。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）或 WAF 层面添加规则，对 `db` 和 `action` 参数过滤 `<script>`、`onerror=` 等 XSS 关键字，并对用户输入进行 HTML 实体编码输出。同时限制 `/bibliopac/bin/wxis.exe/bibliopac/` 路径仅允许可信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.0x90.zone/web/xss/2019/02/01/XSS-Bibliosoft.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16139.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-16139.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16139.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-16139.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2018/16xxx/CVE-2018-16139.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/d8cd4a1ae21f91a5e3337a6b189b078a1a73a4aa/plugins/bibliosoft/bibliopac/CVE-2018-16139.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-16139.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-16139/poc/nuclei/CVE-2018-16139.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-16139.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2018-16139.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-16139.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0101.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0069","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0069.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-12300","title":"希捷 NAS OS 开放重定向漏洞","description":"希捷 Seagate NAS OS 4.3.15.1 版本的 echo-server.html 页面存在开放重定向漏洞（CWE-601），未对 'state' URL 参数进行充分验证。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造包含恶意目标 URL 的 'state' 参数，诱骗用户点击特制链接，导致浏览器将用户重定向至攻击者控制的任意网站。攻击成功时，HTTP Referer 请求头中的敏感信息（如会话令牌、内部 URL 等）可能泄露给攻击者，进而被用于网络钓鱼、凭据窃取或恶意软件分发等后续攻击。该漏洞影响 Seagate NAS OS 4.3.15.1 版本，攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需权限，但需要用户交互（点击恶意链接）才能触发，CVSS v3.0 基础评分 6.1，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-12300"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-05-13T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:37:30Z","remediation":"建议升级 Seagate NAS OS 至 4.3.16.0 或更高版本（含修复补丁），通过 NAS 管理界面“系统更新”手动安装或开启自动更新。若暂无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制 NAS 管理端口（默认 80/443）仅允许可信 IP 访问，并禁用不必要的 Web 服务功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.securityevaluators.com/invading-your-personal-cloud-ise-labs-exploits-the-seagate-stcr3000101-ecf89de2170","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12300.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-12300.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/f5a1370a5c99053077d951ed65ac8cc8cef6e9f7/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12300.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-12300.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-12300-3237.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-12300-3238.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-12300-3239.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-12300-3240.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Seagate NAS OS/CVE-2018-12300.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/Open Redirect/CVE-2018-12300.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e3ffc8aa96e889e4591b3a2ccc4e1f7e6b2ab4fc/cves/2018/12xxx/CVE-2018-12300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0069.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0068","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-12296","title":"希捷 NAS OS 访问控制不当导致信息泄露漏洞","description":"希捷 NAS OS 版本 4.3.15.1 中的 /api/external/7.0/system.System.get_infos 接口存在访问控制不当漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送空的 POST 请求直接调用该接口，获取 NAS 设备的敏感系统信息。该漏洞源于 API 端点未正确验证用户权限，导致匿名用户可访问本应受保护的系统信息。CVSS 评分 7.5，属于高危漏洞，影响使用受影响版本 NAS OS 的希捷存储设备。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-12296"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-05-13T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:37:30Z","remediation":"建议将受影响的软件升级到厂商发布的最新安全版本，或根据官方安全公告应用相应的安全补丁。如暂无补丁，建议采取临时缓解措施限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.securityevaluators.com/invading-your-personal-cloud-ise-labs-exploits-the-seagate-stcr3000101-ecf89de2170","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12296.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2018/CVE-2018-12296.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/f5a1370a5c99053077d951ed65ac8cc8cef6e9f7/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12296.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-12296.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-12296-3236.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-12296-3235.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-12296-3234.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-12296/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2018-12296.py","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/BlackArmor NAS/CVE-2018-12296.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12296.py","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2018/12xxx/CVE-2018-12296.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0068.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0708","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0708.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-4063","title":"Sierra Wireless AirLink ES450 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Sierra Wireless AirLink ES450 工业路由器的 ALEOS 固件中，upload.cgi 功能存在未授权文件上传漏洞。攻击者通过发送特制的 HTTP 请求，可在已认证的情况下向设备上传可执行文件，由于上传路径位于 Web 服务器可路由目录中，上传的可执行文件可被远程调用执行，最终导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Sierra Wireless AirLink ES450 FW 4.9.3 版本，CVSS v3.1 评分为 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-4063"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-05-06T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:58:18Z","remediation":"将 AirLink ES450 的 ALEOS 固件升级至 4.9.4.p09 或更高版本以修复该文件上传漏洞。升级前请通过 Sierra Wireless 授权经销商或技术支持获取固件安装包并遵循官方升级指引。配置方面应使用强密码保护用户账户和 AAF User 账户（遵循 NIST SP800-63B  memorized secret 密码强度规范），并确保直接管理设备时仅通过 HTTPS 连接且浏览器启用 CSRF 防护。临时缓解措施包括：在边界防火墙上限制对设备 Web 管理界面的访问来源，仅允许可信管理 IP 段访问；如无法即时升级且产品已到达生命周期终点，建议停止使用并更换设备。注意该设备可能已处于 EoL/EoS 状态，具体生命周期信息请参考 https://source.sierrawireless.com/resources/airlink/hardware_reference_docs/airlink_es450_eol。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152648/Sierra-Wireless-AirLink-ES450-ACEManager-upload.cgi-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/108147","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-19-122-03","https://talosintelligence.com/vulnerability_reports/TALOS-2018-0748","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-4063","https://www.forescout.com/blog/ot-network-security-threats-industrial-routers-under-attack/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-4063.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/8345550b0eb41caa90e454db2067b575408d9639/2018/CVE-2018-4063.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/187f9782052f1b70e6e7a8a5791a57c9e8021979/cves/2018/4xxx/CVE-2018-4063.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1c86bb14047115fcac2be7eac34405d687b913be/2018/4xxx/CVE-2018-4063.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-4063.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-4063.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3919f5d4f46129b5d413845566be804f8af4ae72/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-4063.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-4063","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-4063.rules","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3919f5d4f46129b5d413845566be804f8af4ae72/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-4063.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0708.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0708.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0708.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0167","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0167.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-20824","title":"Atlassian Jira WallboardServlet 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Atlassian Jira 7.13.1 之前版本中的 WallboardServlet 资源存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 cyclePeriod 参数注入任意 HTML 或 JavaScript 代码，当管理员或其他用户访问被恶意构造的页面时，攻击者可在用户浏览器中执行恶意脚本，窃取会话凭证或执行未授权操作。该漏洞需用户交互触发，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-20824"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-05-03T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:53:33Z","remediation":"升级 Jira 至 7.13.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 WallboardServlet 中 cyclePeriod 参数的 XSS 注入问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层添加规则，对 /rest/wallboard/ 路径下 cyclePeriod 参数进行 HTML 特殊字符过滤，或限制该接口仅允许管理员 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRASERVER-69238","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20824.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-20824.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20824.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-20824.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-20824-3500.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-20824-3503.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-20824-3504.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-20824-3499.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-20824.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/medium/CVE-2018-20824.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Atlassian Confluence/CVE-2018-20824.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0167.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0116","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0116.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-16716","title":"NCBI ToolBox 目录遍历漏洞","description":"NCBI ToolBox 遗留版本（2.0.7 至 2.2.26）中的 viewcgi.c 组件存在目录遍历漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 nph-viewgif.cgi 脚本的查询字符串中注入特殊构造的路径序列（如 ../），绕过路径限制实现任意文件读取，导致敏感信息泄露，甚至可删除服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-16716"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-05-02T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:44:42Z","remediation":"立即将 NCBI ToolBox 升级至 NCBI C++ Toolkit（最新稳定版，支持 C++20，可从 https://github.com/ncbi/ncbi-cxx-toolkit-public/releases 获取源码编译安装）。如无法升级，须从 Web 服务器中删除或禁用 nph-viewgif.cgi 脚本，或在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）配置中对 nph-viewgif.cgi 路径添加访问控制规则，仅允许受信任 IP 访问，同时确保 viewcgi.c 相关 CGI 程序不暴露于公网。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/grymer/CVE/blob/master/CVE-2018-16716.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16716.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-16716.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/b1d25fc0e9d16a9b11c9961a087f80d3b00bf9e5/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16716.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-16716.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-16716-3395.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-16716-3397.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-16716-3396.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2018-16716.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2018/16xxx/CVE-2018-16716.json","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102